---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
interface Props {id?:string;}
const {id='contact'}=Astro.props;
---
<section id={id} class="section cta"><div class="cta-grid"><div class="cta-employer"><div class="eyebrow">FOR EMPLOYERS</div><h2>Tell us who you need.</h2><p>Share the roles, experience and start date. We'll reply within one business day with a clear plan.</p><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button amber" href="/employers/#request-form">Request Candidates <span class="btn-arrow"><Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></span></a><span class="cta-trust">No obligation · One dedicated contact</span></div><a class="text-link cta-contact cta-brief" href="/hiring-brief-builder/">Build your hiring brief <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a><a class="text-link cta-contact cta-general" href="/contact/">Have a general enquiry? Contact us <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div><aside id="candidates" class="cta-candidate"><div class="eyebrow">FOR CANDIDATES</div><h3>Looking for your next role?</h3><p>Send us your CV. We'll contact you when a role matches your skills and experience.</p><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button cta-outline" href="/candidates/">Submit Your CV <span class="btn-arrow"><Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></span></a><span class="cta-note">PDF, DOC or DOCX · max 2 MB</span></div></aside></div></section>
